    title: "Python Symbol.signature hard-capped at 60 chars (8.2% truncated mid-content) + every param default elided to a literal '...'"  # e7ee
    status: todo_hard  # e7ee
    priority: 1  # e7ee
    parent:  # e7ee
    tags:  # e7ee
    - dogfood  # e7ee
